+### Browser access rule
+For any task that requires accessing, reading, or fetching webpage content,
+**default to `~/bin/web-browser`**. Do **not** substitute RSS feeds, `curl`,
+or `wget` for browser-based page retrieval unless I explicitly ask for
+those alternatives. If `~/bin/web-browser` fails, report the failure and
+its reason; do not silently switch to another method.
+
 ### Tests must not write to `~/.hermes/`
 The `_isolate_hermes_home` autouse fixture in `tests/conftest.py` redirects `HERMES_HOME` to a temp dir. Never hardcode `~/.hermes/` paths in tests.
 
